<title>POLAND: RELPOL AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.27 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.36 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.23 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Sales		    2.62 vs   2.41</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.54 vs   3.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.20 vs   3.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.93 vs   4.59</p>
<p> Sales		   25.64 vs  25.25</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electromagnetic transmitter</p>
<p>maker is Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
